#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2342
msgid "How to automatically begin and end filling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2344
msgid ""
"Starting with Python 3.14, you can use the :func:`fill` :term:`context "
"manager` instead of :func:`begin_fill` and :func:`end_fill` to automatically "
"begin and end fill. Here is an example::"
msgstr ""
"A partir do Python 3.14, você pode usar o :term:`gerenciador de "
"contexto` :func:`fill` em vez de :func:`begin_fill` e :func:`end_fill` para "
"iniciar e encerrar o preenchimento automaticamente. Aqui está um exemplo:"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2348
msgid ""
"with fill():\n"
"    for i in range(4):\n"
"        forward(100)\n"
"        right(90)\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"
msgstr ""
"with fill():\n"
"    for i in range(4):\n"
"        forward(100)\n"
"        right(90)\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2355
msgid "The code above is equivalent to::"
msgstr "O código acima equivale a::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2357
msgid ""
"begin_fill()\n"
"for i in range(4):\n"
"    forward(100)\n"
"    right(90)\n"
"end_fill()\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"
msgstr ""
"begin_fill()\n"
"for i in range(4):\n"
"    forward(100)\n"
"    right(90)\n"
"end_fill()\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"

